data:{"type":"MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT","threadId":"vision-edge-deep","runId":"r1","messages":[{"id":"msg_005726327001keglmqX6Ik0J21","role":"user","content":"用 render_a2ui 渲染 surfaceId=e-deep：做 7 层嵌套 —— Column root 套 Card 套 Column 套 Card 套 Column 套 Card 套 Column，最深处一个 Text 写\"第七层深处\"。"},{"id":"msg_005726348001U00wKH1busTksT-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The user wants me to render a deeply nested A2UI structure with surfaceId=e-deep, 7 layers of nesting.\n\nLet me construct the structure:\n- Column (root)\n  - Card\n    - Column\n      - Card\n        - Column\n          - Card\n            - Column\n              - Text \"第七层深处\"\n\nLet me count the layers:\n1. Column (root)\n2. Card\n3. Column\n4. Card\n5. Column\n6. Card\n7. Column\nThen Text \"第七层深处\"\n\nSo 7 nesting layers. Let me build the components array.\n\nThe components are flat, children reference by id. Root's id must be \"root\".\n\nLet me create:\n- Text with id \"deep-text\", text \"第七层深处\"\n- Column id \"col7\" children [\"deep-text\"]\n- Card id \"card6\" child \"col7\"\n- Column id \"col5\" children [\"card6\"]\n- Card id \"card4\" child \"col5\"\n- Column id \"col3\" children [\"card4\"]\n- Card id \"card2\" child \"col3\"\n- Column id \"root\" children [\"card2\"]\n\nThat's 7 layers."},{"id":"msg_005726348001U00wKH1busTksT","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_XLQyhgQXXJ7ZOGptOcUI3573","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"surfaceId\":\"e-deep\",\"components\":[{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"root\",\"children\":[\"card2\"]},{\"component\":\"Card\",\"id\":\"card2\",\"child\":\"col3\"},{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"col3\",\"children\":[\"card4\"]},{\"component\":\"Card\",\"id\":\"card4\",\"child\":\"col5\"},{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"col5\",\"children\":[\"card6\"]},{\"component\":\"Card\",\"id\":\"card6\",\"child\":\"col7\"},{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"col7\",\"children\":[\"deep-text\"]},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"deep-text\",\"text\":\"第七层深处\"}]}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_XLQyhgQXXJ7ZOGptOcUI3573","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_XLQyhgQXXJ7ZOGptOcUI3573","content":"UI surface \"e-deep\" rendered (8 components). The user can already see it; do NOT paste the JSON back into chat."},{"id":"msg_0057270cc001j5QBbetGHAeMFQ","role":"assistant","content":"已渲染，7 层嵌套：Column→Card→Column→Card→Column→Card→Column→Text(\"第七层深处\")。"}]}

